# SiliconFlow — 72-model gateway (Qwen/DeepSeek/GLM/Kimi/MiniMax/Tencent/gemma LLMs, FLUX images, fish-speech/IndexTTS/CosyVoice TTS, Qwen3-Embedding, Qwen3-Reranker). Use INTERNATIONAL endpoint https://api.siliconflow.com/v1 (not .cn — different key domain). https://cloud.siliconflow.com/account/ak
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=sk-your-siliconflow-key-here
